Domain Mapping for Multi‑Site WAF

Each virtual host must resolve to the

applies rules per domain.

Add the following entries:

127.0.0.1       localhost

192.168.1.160  site-one.local

192.168.1.160  site-two.local

192.168.1.160  site-three.local

# The following lines are desirable for IPv6 capable hosts

::1     localhost ip6-localhost ip6-loopback

ff02::2 ip6-allrouters

Test the configuration:

systemctl restart nginx

